Hi Martin,

On Wednesday 31 May 2006 16:10, Martin Margraf wrote:
> so, i compiled u-boot 1.1.4 (latest version from
> ftp://ftp.denx.de/pub/u-boot and with the patches available from
> http://omap.spectrumdigital.com/osk5912/osk5912_faq.html) and my 2.6.16.18
> kernel with ELDK 3.1.1 and i get the following error.

I think I mentioned this a few times on this list. Please *don't* use any 
older versions of U-Boot. Even not 1.1.4 release from end of last year. 
Please use current top-of-git tree version:

http://www.denx.de/en/Software/GIT

I integrated the patches from Spectrumdigital a few weeks ago in this version. 
For those without git access I attached the OMAP5912OSK binary.

Hope this helps.

Best regards,
Stefan

